              </TextRun>
              <TextRun>
                <Value>untuk periode </Value>
                <Style>
                  <FontStyle>Normal</FontStyle>
                  <FontFamily>Times New Roman</FontFamily>
                  <FontWeight>Normal</FontWeight>
                  <TextDecoration>None</TextDecoration>
                  <Color>#000000</Color>
                </Style>
              </TextRun>
              <TextRun>
                <Label>PolicyStartDate</Label>
                <Value>=First(Fields!PolicyStartDate.Value, "RPT_UW_PROFITSHARING_MEMOKLAIM_HEADER")</Value>
                <Style>
                  <FontStyle>Normal</FontStyle>
                  <FontFamily>Times New Roman</FontFamily>
                  <FontWeight>Normal</FontWeight>
                  <TextDecoration>None</TextDecoration>
                  <Color>#000000</Color>
                </Style>
              </TextRun>
              <TextRun>
                <Value> s/d </Value>
                <Style>
                  <FontStyle>Normal</FontStyle>
                  <FontFamily>Times New Roman</FontFamily>
                  <FontWeight>Normal</FontWeight>
                  <TextDecoration>None</TextDecoration>
                  <Color>#000000</Color>
                </Style>
              </TextRun>
              <TextRun>
                <Label>PolicyEndDate</Label>
                <Value>=First(Fields!PolicyEndDate.Value, "RPT_UW_PROFITSHARING_MEMOKLAIM_HEADER")</Value>
                <Style>
                  <FontStyle>Normal</FontStyle>
                  <FontFamily>Times New Roman</FontFamily>
                  <FontWeight>Normal</FontWeight>
                  <TextDecoration>None</TextDecoration>
                  <Color>#000000</Color>
                </Style>
              </TextRun>
              <TextRun>
                <Value>. Berdasarkan hal tersebut di atas, mohon diinformasikan kepada kami apakah seluruh pengajuan Klaim Provider dan Reimbursement untuk periode Asuransi sebelumnya telah selesai diproses?</Value>
